                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "b4374e4e-8ccb-45d3-b3a4-648fa7c5c733",
                        "entry_id": "fc07b1ad-9099-30b6-a46c-0eebb89a58f9",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "placebos"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "dedef56a-3b8f-47c1-879b-52f3059e8a77",
                        "entry_id": "fc07b1ad-9099-30b6-a46c-0eebb89a58f9",
                        "tags": [
                            "orthographe rectifiée de 1990"
                        ],
                        "form": "placébo"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d3e7da95-efcd-3aae-b0ea-f0635380bbaf",
                        "entry_id": "fc07b1ad-9099-30b6-a46c-0eebb89a58f9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Imitation de médicament sans principe actif, utilisée pour les tests en double aveugle ou pour son effet sur le psychisme de certains patients."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "49aec8f4-7654-41b3-ad11-22c3b7a35184",
                                "sense_id": "d3e7da95-efcd-3aae-b0ea-f0635380bbaf",
                                "text": "Elle tentait de me faire entendre que je ne devais pas devenir dépendant, on me donnait des calmants sans effet, des placebos que je déjouais comme tels, tout entier mobilisé dans l’attente du retour de l’extase, de l’heure bénie de ma drogue."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f654763a-ff53-4641-94d8-adaf6549e023",
                                "sense_id": "d3e7da95-efcd-3aae-b0ea-f0635380bbaf",
                                "text": "\"Environ la moitié des participants ont reçu les deux doses du vaccin, et l’autre moitié, un placebo. Ensuite, on a laissé les gens retourner à la communauté\" et vaquer à leurs occupations en étant possiblement exposés au virus."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d3067e7e-7071-3e6b-a3e8-383a7067acc5",
                        "entry_id": "fc07b1ad-9099-30b6-a46c-0eebb89a58f9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Toutes formes d'ersatz."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "analogy"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d36e448d-effc-464a-8baa-9453fff75e1f",
                                "sense_id": "d3067e7e-7071-3e6b-a3e8-383a7067acc5",
                                "text": "La logique, c'est le placebo de l'intelligence."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e5200c88-80f6-4a52-8082-e416a485b8cd",
                        "source_entry_id": "fc07b1ad-9099-30b6-a46c-0eebb89a58f9",
                        "target_lang_word": "placebo",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "placebo",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "955cbd28-c60c-36ff-8d65-371f4837b759",
                                        "entry_id": "97b1f8a2-dede-3cb2-b97c-06e7548fc3ea",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A dummy medicine containing no active ingredients; an inert treatment."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4cd9d229-7ab6-411f-9247-341199649cea",
                                                "sense_id": "955cbd28-c60c-36ff-8d65-371f4837b759",
                                                "text": "The acid test, I thought, was whether homeopathic remedies behave differently from placebos when submitted to clinical trials."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5a8524fe-4b5d-40eb-99c4-42398924cdd2",
                                                "sense_id": "955cbd28-c60c-36ff-8d65-371f4837b759",
                                                "text": "The trials overall showed some but limited effectiveness, and in one of the largest and longest trials, the placebo performed better in treating spasticity, pain and bladder dysfunction, Dr. Bowling wrote."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d2b5c4d0-6c4b-339b-8212-fbe662260b35",
                                        "entry_id": "97b1f8a2-dede-3cb2-b97c-06e7548fc3ea",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The vespers sung in the office for the dead."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "52fe0894-863d-4479-85f9-3f33bf265c63",
                                                "sense_id": "d2b5c4d0-6c4b-339b-8212-fbe662260b35",
                                                "text": "There the placebo, the office for the dead, was sung, and a vigil kept throughout the night."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
